    <briefdescription>
<para>Macros that select the code compiled into the library. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every macro has a default and may be overridden in one of two ways:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>on the compiler command line (<computeroutput>-DSSTEP_CFG_MATH_BACKEND=SSTEP_MATH_BACKEND_FLOAT</computeroutput>), or</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>in a user header <computeroutput>sstep_user_config.h</computeroutput>, included when the macro <computeroutput>SSTEP_USER_CONFIG</computeroutput> is defined (CMake: set <computeroutput>SSTEP_CONFIG_DIR</computeroutput> to its folder).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Values that cannot change at run time (code size, table sizes, which code paths exist) live here. Motor and board parameters are run-time values passed to <ref refid="group__sstep__api_1ga860a37e9ab847bb02f4102e98ea92e1c" kindref="member">sstep_init()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
